        return n
    return fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2)
```

What does the following mutually recursive pair print for `isEven(4)`?
```python
def is_even(n):
    if n == 0:
        return True
    return is_odd(n - 1)

def is_odd(n):
    if n == 0:
        return False
    return is_even(n - 1)

print(is_even(4))
```

